    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d9f5377b202b86330ec0b27",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "名将怒涛她，终于\n超越好歌剧她们这些并列于场上的强敌，\n并站上顶点了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1997c0de9cb0120b2e209431ffcafddd3b79ef9b0b8c9b912caf8cb5f92c3db4",
